  "description": "The sweet office romance unfolds in a world that has been animalized ♡ \n\nDa-Eun, who works as usual, hears the rumor that an employee from another company will come, and that they will carry out a project together. The employee who attracted the attention of people in the company with his handsome looks, was none other than Da-Eun's long-time unrequited love, Jun-Hyeok. Can Da-Eun capture Jun-Hyeok now that they met again? \n\n(Source: Mr. Blue, translated)",
